  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "The as-cast NbMoCrTiAl alloy has a coarse microstructure.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The as-cast NbMoCrTiAl alloy exhibits brittle cleavage fracture.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "High-energy planetary ball milling with stearic acid followed by SPS at about 1700 °C and 30 MPa can produce an NbMoCrTiAl composite containing in-situ-formed TiC and Al2O3.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7513042::rubric_card::000::c40db9eaa7"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "TiC is the primary ceramic reinforcement and Al2O3 is the minor ceramic reinforcement.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7513042::rubric_card::000::c40db9eaa7"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The TiC and Al2O3 reinforcements produced by this process are nanoscale.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The processed material contains a BCC matrix.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7513042::rubric_card::000::c40db9eaa7"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The processing route produces a fine-grained matrix with a homogeneous particle distribution.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The ceramic particles promote grain refinement, defect pinning, and crack deflection.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The ceramic particles impede dislocation motion and crack propagation.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Grain refinement improves ductility and load repartitioning.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Strong particle-matrix interfaces reduce debonding and enable effective stress transfer.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The powder-metallurgy route can increase the compressive strength of NbMoCrTiAl by approximately 50% relative to the as-cast alloy.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7513042::rubric_card::000::c40db9eaa7"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The processed alloy will have greater ductility than the as-cast alloy.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The processed alloy will have a higher Young's modulus than the as-cast alloy.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The processed alloy will have greater fracture resistance than the as-cast alloy.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The as-cast NbMoCrTiAl baseline has a compressive strength of about 1010 MPa.",
      "field": "baseline",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7513042::rubric_card::000::c40db9eaa7"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "A reinforcement volume fraction that is too high will cause embrittlement, whereas one that is too low will fail to enhance strength.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "A VEC above a critical value inherently promotes brittleness and may prevent ductility improvement.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The hypothesis is falsified if the processed specimens fail to show simultaneous improvements of at least 50% in strength and at least 10% in both ductility and Young's modulus relative to as-cast controls.",
      "field": "falsification_experiment.falsification_rule",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
